                                        "entry_id": "c460ebc0-c1fc-3883-b7f8-4e5702e73d13",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A confidence game in which the victim, or mark, is tricked into betting a sum of money that they can find the money card, for example the queen of hearts, among three face-down playing cards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d17224f9-58e7-47c6-a861-b9663f98a48c",
                                                "sense_id": "796725a4-7b89-3593-9d0d-94afdd7b22bf",
                                                "text": "A starry 20th-anniversary revival of “Topdog/Underdog,” her Pulitzer Prize-winning fable about two brothers, three-card monte and one troubling inheritance, is in previews on Broadway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
